This package is a personal derivative of pi-sakura-cyberdeck by beautifulrem.
Original project: https://github.com/beautifulrem/pi-sakura-cyberdeck
License: MIT.

This package contains a dynamic HUD footer for Pi, adapted from the Footer
portion of pi-zentui by Luka: https://github.com/lmilojevicc/pi-zentui
License: MIT.

Session, model, activity, MCP, configuration-count, and Codex subscription
status capabilities are adapted from pi-shannon-statusline by RealAlexandreAI:
https://github.com/RealAlexandreAI/pi-shannon-statusline
License: MIT. The integrated presentation has been rewritten for the HUD footer;
Shannon's HUD, Matrix animation, independent Footer, and Monokai palette are
not included.

The Codex usage client included under extensions/hud/telemetry/codex-usage
derives from pi-codex-usage by narumiruna and is MIT licensed. Its full license
text is kept at extensions/hud/telemetry/codex-usage/LICENSE.